  "description": "‼️ 𝕎𝔼𝕃ℂ𝕆𝕄𝔼 𝕋𝕆 𝔻𝔼ℙ𝕋ℍ 1 ‼️\n\n════════════════════════\n\n💠 Opportunity to join our main guild if active and reach the required combat level (combat level 80+)\n\n════════════════════════\n\nWe are a semi-casual guild.\nYou will be kicked if you have 1 week of no - very low guild activity.-\n\n════════════════════════\n\n𝙧𝙚𝙦𝙪𝙞𝙧𝙚𝙢𝙚𝙣𝙩𝙨:\n\n🔸️Combat Lvl : 40+\n\n🔸️Participate in raids\n\n🔸️Contribute to challenges\n\n🔸️Deposit to stockpile regularly\n\n🔸️Participate in Conquest\n\n\n════════════════════════\n\n𝘿𝙞𝙨𝙘𝙤𝙧𝙙 𝙞𝙨 𝙣𝙤𝙩 𝙖 𝙢𝙪𝙨𝙩 𝙗𝙪𝙩 𝙞𝙩 𝙞𝙨 𝙚𝙭𝙩𝙧𝙚𝙢𝙚𝙡𝙮 𝙧𝙚𝙘𝙤𝙢𝙢𝙚𝙣𝙙𝙚𝙙 𝙛𝙤𝙧:\n\n🔹️Raid alerts\n\n🔹️World boss alerts\n\n🔹️Shrine alerts\n\n🔹️ Conquest Assault info\n\n\n☎️📞Discord link📞☎️:\n\nhttps://discord.gg/QYKsQnMTJC\n\n════════════════════════\n\n🔥🔥🔥𝗥𝗔𝗜𝗗𝗦🔥🔥🔥\n\n🔸️(𝘾𝙡𝙫𝙡 40 Raids). 20:00 , 19:00(GMT+0 UK) Sunday-Thursday. : (ACTIVE ✅️)\n\n🔸️(Clvl 40 Raids) 20:00 (GMT +0 UK) Friday-Saturday (inactive ⛔️)\n\n🔸️🥚🍫 𝙀𝙫𝙚𝙣𝙩 𝙧𝙖𝙞𝙙: (INACTIVE⛔️) - SAME TIME AS NORMAL RAIDS, 3 RAIDS BACK TO BACK EVERYDAY INCLUDING WEEKENDS.\n\n════════════════════════\n\nOther guilds include\n\n💠 Depth (Main Guild)\n\n💠 Depth Cursed (class locked guild)\n\n🤘𝗛𝗲𝗹𝗽 𝘄𝗶𝘁𝗵 𝗴𝘂𝗶𝗹𝗱 𝗮𝗰𝘁𝗶𝘃𝗶𝘁𝗶𝗲𝘀 𝗿𝗲𝗴𝘂𝗹𝗮𝗿𝗹𝘆🤟\n\n𝕶𝖊𝖊𝖕 𝖆𝖈𝖙𝖎𝖛𝖊 𝖆𝖓𝖉 𝖐𝖊𝖊𝖕 𝖌𝖗𝖔𝖜𝖎𝖓𝖌.",
